# ---- CMake / headless kernel build ----
out/

# Tools/Atlas writes its map here when --out is not given (Main.cpp defaults to
# "aelvor.json"), so it lands wherever the tool was run from - the repository
# root, whenever somebody replays a stream by hand. It is output and never
# source; the CTest entries all pass --out into their own build directory.
aelvor.json
